  lines:
    '|a||Really? in Russian: же, ведь, разве, неужели':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6600
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||The little Russian words that carry a feeling: же, ведь, ра́зве, неуже́ли, with кста́ти, наве́рное and зна́чит. Ольга wants a talk, and Tom worries.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 14240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ayt0mz'
    '|a||Февра́ль. A message from О́льга, my head chef: нам на́до поговори́ть. I don''t like the sound of that, so I phone Masha.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 10120
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Послу́шайте.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1g34vll'
    '|a||Ма́ша, О́льга хо́чет поговори́ть со мной. Неуже́ли я сде́лал оши́бку?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 5600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:fpqb5c'
    '|b||Ра́зве ты де́лаешь оши́бки? Ты ведь лу́чший по́вар в «Неве́»!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Ну, не лу́чший… Кста́ти, ты свобо́дна в суббо́ту?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Наве́рное. Зна́чит, в суббо́ту всё расска́жешь!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3840
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Who wants to talk to Tom?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2040
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||О́льга хо́чет поговори́ть со мной.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2480
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||What does Masha think of Tom?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2440
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ты лу́чший по́вар в «Неве́»!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2760
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||When will Tom tell Masha everything?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||В суббо́ту: on Saturday.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2640
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Посмотри́те. Неуже́ли я сде́лал оши́бку? Неуже́ли: really? can it be? Surprise, at good news or bad.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 11080
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Ра́зве ты де́лаешь оши́бки?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2040
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:ook2ou'
    '|a||Ра́зве: surely not? Masha expects the answer no.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4600
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:z3ueeq'
    '|b||Ты ведь лу́чший по́вар!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2000
      voice: 'gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated #ctx:21amha'
    '|a||Ведь: after all, as you know.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:n9bk8c'
    '|a||And же. Я же говори́л! I told you so! Где же он? Where on earth is it?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7400
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:66q16e'
    '|a||Же usually presses on the word just before it.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:zi5sbs'
    '|a||Неуже́ли, ра́зве, ведь, же: they mostly don''t change the facts; they add a feeling. Red marks these little words.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 9680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1vytb3'
    '|a||They make speech warm; a letter keeps few of them.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4080
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1bkov3n'
    '|a||Ещё три сло́ва. Кста́ти, ты свобо́дна в суббо́ту? Кста́ти: by the way.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6240
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:4y7k0o'
    '|a||Наве́рное: probably. Зна́чит: so, that means. Зна́чит, в суббо́ту!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8280
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1olj5oc'
    '|a||Тепе́рь вы. Неуже́ли or ра́зве? Послу́шайте Ма́шу.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1yb0f0y'
    '|a||Ма́ша, Ди́ма сего́дня пришёл на рабо́ту ра́но!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3680
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1h9uz7o'
    '|b||Неуже́ли? Молоде́ц!':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2760
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||А за́втра у меня́ выходно́й.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|b||Ра́зве? Я ду́мала, ты рабо́таешь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2720
      voice: gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated
    '|a||Dima came early. How does Masha take it?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 3360
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Неуже́ли? Молоде́ц! Surprised, and glad.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4560
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Tom says he has tomorrow off. How does Masha take it?':
      mp3: 
      ms: 4880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Ра́зве? Я ду́мала, ты рабо́таешь.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 2880
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||О́льга хо́чет поговори́ть. Here по- means for a little while: поговори́ть, to have a talk.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 7520
      voice: gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would
    '|a||Заче́м? What for? It asks for a purpose, and the answer is often что́бы.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6840
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1uvta7w'
    '|a||Почему́ asks for the cause: потому́ что. In speech the two often overlap.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 6360
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1kpcc40'
    '|a||You know кто́-то and что́-нибудь from lesson 117. Како́й works the same. У неё каки́е-то но́вости.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 8880
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:12p2g3n'
    '|a||Купи́ како́й-нибудь торт! Any cake at all.':
