      ms: 4440
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:ltzagw'
    '|a||Вы́берите сло́во.':
      mp3: 
      ms: 1480
      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:m526mu'
    '|a||Опя́ть хо́лодно! Я же говори́л!':
