      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:uapt9n'
    '|a||Сего́дня суббо́та. Ра́зве? Я ду́мал, пя́тница.':
