      voice: 'gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would #ctx:1kngmai'
    '|a||Я бою́сь. Ты ведь лу́чший по́вар!':
